Focus only on reconstructing:

1. urgent order → nurse action;
2. requisition/sample delay;
3. sample transport/courier exception;
4. blood-bank processing state;
5. unit issue;
6. unit transport;
7. bedside receipt;
8. transfusion start;
9. where ownership becomes unclear;
10. where an urgent case can become invisible.

Do not add extra checkpoints.

